Z||000024||FieroJoe||01-29-2001||10:10 PM||||Spelling I can live with once and a while, as long as I can decipher the intent of the word.  Punctuation is a different story.  Run on sentances are a pain.  There has been times that I was going to post a reply to a topic, but I decided not to because the whole topic was one large sentence, and I really didnt have a clue to what they were really trying to ask.<P>So here, use periods, and dont type in all caps, that gets annoying too.||||reg||1
