Z||000041||Fformula88||02-05-2001||06:35 PM||||I recently asked a clutch question since we recently got a 4 spd Fiero.  I received some helpful replies and some "use the search" replies.  I figured it was a direct question and someone could easily answer it instead of sifting thru the hundreds of clutch posts that must be here.  <P>Don't get me wrong, I have used the search often enough, but some stuff has been covered with so much detail that its easier to just ask.<P>The cold "use the search" replies are what really get me.  Usually someone answers the question anyway so I see little reason in posting this response.  People ask those  questions for help, and replies like that are very frustrating when your working out a problem.  Just my $.02<P>Peace||||reg||1
